#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:5
msgid "Romance Scams – HSBC HK"
msgstr "網戀騙局 - 香港滙豐"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:11
msgid "How to Protect Your Heart (and Bank Account) from Romance Scams"
msgstr "網戀騙局偷心又偷金，您會中招嗎？"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:13
msgid "Cyber security &amp; fraud hub"
msgstr "網路安全及防詐騙資訊中心"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:18
msgid ""
"\"You and I are one and the same: we both know what a broken heart feels "
"like. I'm so lucky to have found you.\""
msgstr "“我同您一樣都受過情傷，遇上您實在太幸運！”"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:19
msgid "\"I really miss you. What have you been up to this past week?\""
msgstr "“我好掛住您，您呢幾日做咗啲乜？”"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:20
msgid ""
"While these sweet words may sound like music to anyone's ears, they could"
" also be a ploy used by scammers to catfish you and try to prompt you to "
"reveal more about your personal life."
msgstr "這些可能是一般的甜言蜜語，但也可能是網戀騙子假扮理想伴侶、打探個人背景的對白。"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:21
msgid ""
"If you've never met this person in real life, you should be extra "
"careful. Scammers may invest time in building up a certain level of trust"
" with you to become a regular fixture in your life. Once that happens, "
"things could quickly start to go wrong:"
msgstr "如果對方是素未謀面的網友，那您就要加倍小心。在他們「放長線」與您建立信任，並成為您生活中的一部分後，對白就可能由普通的噓寒問暖，變成："

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:22
msgid ""
"\"I've been travelling and I'm out of town right now, so I can't meet up "
"with you. Also, can you believe my bad luck? My webcam has just stopped "
"working!\""
msgstr "“我唔喺香港，唔可以同您見面，咁啱個cam又壞咗，真黑仔！”"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:23
msgid ""
"\"I'm a little short on cash right now. Could you help me out by wiring "
"some money to tide me over? Even a few thousand dollars would help.\""
msgstr "“我呢排周轉困難，您可唔可以匯款俾我？幾千蚊都得。”"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:24
msgid ""
"When someone you consider your 'online soulmate' is constantly making "
"excuses not to meet up and is always asking you for money, would you "
"still believe you've found 'the one'?"
msgstr "當您的「網上伴侶」不停推託和您見面，一次又一次地向您索取金錢，您還會相信對方嗎？"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:27
msgid "Tips to protect your heart and your pocket from online love scams"
msgstr "防範網戀騙局貼士"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:28
msgid ""
"Always stay alert. Never send money to people you don't know much about. "
"Don't give in to the initial rush of emotions you may feel after finding "
"a connection with someone online. Take a pause, look out for red flags "
"and take these steps before shelling out."
msgstr "不想當局者迷，人財兩失，就要時常保持警惕，不要輕易向認識不深的人匯款。當您為網上「真愛」情迷意亂的時候，先停一停，回想您倆相處時有沒有甚麼警號，再做好以下措施，不要將錢包雙手奉上。"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:30
msgid "Protect your personal information:"
msgstr "保護個人資料"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:30
msgid ""
"Don't give sensitive information to people you've never met, including "
"your bank account details and passwords."
msgstr "千萬不要向素未謀面的人提供銀行戶口及密碼等敏感資料。"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:31
msgid "Don't overshare on social media:"
msgstr "避免在社交媒體分享太多個人資料"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:31
msgid ""
"Scammers can easily piece together a story from the information you share"
" on your social media accounts and target you with social engineering "
"attacks."
msgstr "以免騙徒用「社交工程」技倆哄您上當。"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:32
msgid "Keep your guard up if the excuses start pouring in:"
msgstr "諸多推搪要小心"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:32
msgid ""
"Are you starting to receive lots of excuses from your online lover about "
"why they can't turn on their webcam or meet you in person? That's a huge "
"red flag. Stay alert."
msgstr "如果「網上伴侶」總是不和您見面，必須警覺。"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:33
msgid "Don't reveal your finances:"
msgstr "不要告訴別人您的財務狀况"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:33
msgid ""
"If they start asking about your finances or asking for money, you should "
"be cautious."
msgstr "當對方詢問您的財務狀况，甚至要求您匯錢時，就要特別小心。"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:34
msgid "Don't blindly trust information they provide:"
msgstr "不要輕易相信他們提供的資料"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:34
msgid ""
"The photos or selfies they've sent you might be fake, so it's best to do "
"your own verification. Use an app or go online to reverse image search "
"what they sent you. The back story of their lives could also be made up. "
"Ask questions and do your own research to check the details."
msgstr "有圖未必有真相，您可以在網上以圖搜圖，確認照片真假。您也可以試探對方，查證對方的背景資料是否屬實。"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:36
msgid ""
"Love scammers are well-versed at their art of deception and know exactly "
"how to tug at your heartstrings. Don't let their sweet talk lure you into"
" handing over your money, bank details or other personal data."
msgstr "網上情緣騙徒善於牽動您的情緒，令您不能自拔，花言巧語千萬不要信以為真。"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:37
msgid "If you think you've been scammed,"
msgstr "如果懷疑已經遇上詐騙，請即時"

#: frontend/templates/romance-scams.html:37
msgid "report it to HSBC immediately"
msgstr "向我們舉報。"

